<description>&lt;p&gt;ELN guerrillas used an armed drone to kill a soldier in Cauca while the Colombian Air Force bombed an ELN camp, killing at least three combatants. The Colombian army airstrike that killed four suspected rebels, including a teenager, followed a car bomb outside a toll booth in the Cauca region, and FARC dissidents carried out three car bombs on the Panamerican Highway in seven days. A Colombian peace tribunal charged former FARC members with anti-Indigenous crimes and war crimes against Indigenous groups. The United Kingdom pledged to continue championing the 2016 peace agreement at the UN Security Council, and 225 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168580&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxObUVqdXVtVUFCMDgyZ3c2dVptc2dndnQzTjdIRE9VLUM3MXMySDlfY2FqQkFfbmZyVGI2WkZIc0VyN2VmSTF1TEVqYXdNTEY4TDU2MHRlajlxem1mX29ta1p4NW1jUnBsZUQ4UjkyN1hPaWpzekpiYzV1bldQTi0tT1h3MVdLd28tR1FSY0pXVE9mTnV1WGlxNzlVM0lDLVdhYW5uQjhpckE1aVBoZ0hNb3hJLUlMdjZs0gG-AUFVX3lxTFBzYVVYZnBpQnFlMEFUQ3RCb2NrMERyQkhGQ1VCM0lIWm5zaXM5QkV6S2ZlQnpmNHZmNHROSXE1eHZYQ21waVFCVHJpZVd0c3BaQ3ZQUFduRkdlS1psczc5MXp5TWZOcDZmN2cwZlNDM185Y0hQbWtYcDlURk14TnhSeExrVm1NVndyRFJpcTRKVUNpOUsyTG9FejhMeEJ6WnpVRm05M0lKT3c1OEV5Nk84dUdGcDFmLXZTQnFZMmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQZHVRY2JmVHRoUmpEV24xc2RlNTBRaEZDYXoxSGQ1SGJsX1BnSGVGaFdtWHRKYkMtRXFsLTRzZlRjTGtXZzVVOVNMNVpsQzhrWEtpTkFHQW5yYmxlNFBTOVlpNDJDQlExc201WV8yUUM0clNZa0ZZMnZGYlFEQnZOLXh5MzlUcUNEOTgwUDRqOXdfUUtCRjhVVGJzZ1pnS0xta3ZhNXpmYUw5cWlRVkRrQW9qWXhQQjliU3JlUGU0YkdsWjFDQ3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQTExoUE5Ya0tBcHZtbGRD